flowchart TB
  Customer[Customer Browser]
  Frontend[Container: Next.js Frontend / BFF]
  Gateway[Container: Nginx API Gateway]
  Redis[(Container: Redis - Streams, Pub/Sub, Cache)]
  Mongo[(Container: MongoDB - service-owned collections)]

  User[Container: user-service]
  Product[Container: product-service]
  Order[Container: order-service]
  Payment[Container: payment-service]
  Email[Container: email-service]
  Chat[Container: chat-bot-service]

  Firebase[External: Firebase Auth]
  SePay[External: SePay API/Webhook]
  SMTP[External: SMTP/Brevo]
  Gemini[External: Gemini API]

  Customer --> Frontend
  Frontend -->|Next.js rewrites /api/*| Gateway
  Gateway --> User
  Gateway --> Product
  Gateway --> Order
  Gateway --> Payment
  Gateway --> Chat

  User --> Mongo
  Product --> Mongo
  Order --> Mongo
  Payment --> Mongo
  Chat --> Mongo

  User -->|auth.otp.requested| Redis
  Product <-->|cache-aside product list/detail| Redis
  Product <-->|order.created, order.cancelled| Redis
  Order <-->|payment.completed, stock.*, order.*| Redis
  Payment <-->|payment.completed, order.cancelled, pub/sub payment status| Redis
  Email <-->|auth.otp.requested, order.created, idempotency keys| Redis
  Frontend -->|payment-wait long polling subscriber| Redis

  User --> Firebase
  Payment --> SePay
  SePay --> Payment
  Email --> SMTP
  Chat --> Gemini

